      },
      {
        "heading": "Who are Thundercat Technology's main customers and markets?",
        "body": "The Department of Veterans Affairs is the top buyer in FY2027 to date with $142M in obligations. Other named buyers include the Department of Agriculture $4.9M and the National Aeronautics and Space Administration $3.9M. The leading reported market is Other Computer Related Services with $154M, while Software Publishers shows $0."
      }
